            {
                "comment": "Professor Hustad is the reason I decided to declare the CSD major. She's always positive and very clear with her expectations. Not a lot of homework, and if you actually pay attention in class you'll do very well. Don't be on your phone as she does notice.  Very forgiving of situations that may arise.",
